alent of coupling a church organ and a gospel organ) but used it only to dress up stately, elegant…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":59,"text":"…progressive-rock. The magniloquent, symphonic sound of Ian McDonald's mellotron enrolled them in the neo-classical movement of Nice, Moody Blues and Procol Harum, but the psychedelic overtones, the medieval visions, the gothic atmosphere and the romantic pathos of the title-track and Epitaph set them clearly…"}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Gary Brooker's Death from Cancer","body":"Gary Brooker, a co-founder of the progressive rock band Procol Harum, passed away from cancer at the age of 76 on February 19th. \"Gary Brooker was a co-founder of the Prague band Prokoharum, cancer took him at 76 on February the 19th.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"In Memoriam of Those Lost in 2022","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sdPeii-8Ysw"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":176076881398217,"type":"song","name":"A Whiter Shade of Pale","work_year":1967,"list_id":212684728441441,"list":"Billboard Year-End 1967","src":"singles","rank":38,"year":1967,"note":"","yt":"z0vCwGUZe1I","scaruffi":null},{"id":176076881398217,"type":"song","name":"A Whiter Shade of Pale","work_year":1967,"list_id":132335824845498,"list":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","src":"charts","rank":38,"year":1967,"note":null,"yt":"z0vCwGUZe1I","scaruffi":null},{"id":176076881398217,"type":"song","name":"A Whiter Shade of Pale","work_year":1967,"list_id":149816913074890,"list":"Los 40 nº1 · 1967","src":"singles","rank":12,"year":1967,"note":"2 semanas","yt":"z0vCwGUZe1I","scaruffi":null},{"id":83849895333091,"type":"album","name":"Procol Harum","list_id":114383129677180,"list":"RYM Top — Psychedelia — Psychedelic Pop","src":"musthear","rank":91,"year":1967,"note":null,"yt":"vlDYKjfnZ44","scaruffi":null},{"id":83849895333091,"type":"album","na